      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "To escape this forsaken place, two cursed artifacts must be found and
    destroyed. They are the key to breaking the grip of this mansion's curse. Without
    their destruction, you will remain trapped here, forever ensnared in its darkness.\n\nBut
    beware, the path is fraught with deception. Two girls walk these halls\u2014one
    will guide you, while the other will mislead you. Their appearances may be similar,
    but their intentions are worlds apart."
