  m_text: 'To uncover the answer you seek,

    Count the glimmers that softly speak.

    How
    many <color=#8d8a32>lights</color> in the room do glow,

    A number only you
    would know.


    Doors that welcome, how many swing <color=#0479c7>wide</color>?

    Reveal
    the paths where you stride.


    Objects you <color=#FF0000>passed</color> on
    your questing spree,

    Add them together; what is the key?


    -Note Keeper'
